        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2043, Empire Arch Mortise Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Empire Arch Pocket Door Keyed Entry is a secure pocket door lock that is a beautiful as it is functional. The latch hooks into the door frame to secure the pocket door and is operated by a key from the exterior and by a thumbturn from the interior (see picture below for interior trim). This #8 Keyed Mortise Pocket Door Lock will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick minimum. The arched trim plates are 1/8 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-dummy-set-emtek-2046\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-passage-set-emtek-2044\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/empire-arch-pocket-door-privacy-set-emtek-2045\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the #8 Arched Keyed Mortise Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finger Grab Dimensions: 7/8\"w x 2\"h</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise faceplate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2043-specifications.pdf?v=1704262425\"><b>Emtek 2043 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a keyed mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
